# QA warning chip: delete the fins (stability drops) and read the status strip chip. cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/qa-warning.drive out/qa-warning
viewport 1280x760
scale 1
click (925, 583)
click (1257, 62)
click "Delete"
screenshot nofins-dark.png
click "1 error"
screenshot issues-dark.png
# A click outside closes the issues list (the headless driver delivers keys to widgets only, so Escape does not reach the app).
click (640, 300)
click "Prefs"
click "Light"
click "Done"
screenshot nofins-light.png
